.TH "whipper-cd" "1" "2020" ""
.SH "نام (NAME)"
whipper-cd \- Display and rip CD-DA and metadata
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.nf
whipper cd \fB\-d\fP \fI<DEVICE>\fP [\fBsubcommand\fP]
whipper cd \fB\-h\fP
.fi
.sp
.SH Subcommands
.nf
\fBinfo\fP  Retrieve information about the currently inserted CD
\fBrip\fP   Rip the CD
.fi
.sp
.nf
For more details on these subcommands, see their respective man pages.
.fi
.sp
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.nf
\fB\-h\fP | \fB\-\-help\fP
.in +2
Show this help message and exit
.in -2
.fi
.sp
.nf
\fB\-d\fP \fI<DEVICE>\fP | \fB\-\-device\fP \fI<DEVICE>\fP
.in +2
Path to the CD\-DA device
.in -2
.fi
.sp
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.sp
whipper(1), whipper\-cd\-info(1), whipper\-cd\-rip(1)
.SH "نویسنده (AUTHOR)"
